WEBVTT

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.184 --> 00:00:03.965
You've booked, but you'd like to check the time again,

00:00:03.915 --> 00:00:06.190
or something came up and you need to cancel?

00:00:06.532 --> 00:00:09.950
You can do it all yourself under My bookings, without calling the salon.

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:14.121
Sign in, tap your name at the top, and choose My bookings.

00:00:14.511 --> 00:00:19.486
Each booking shows the salon, the service, the date and time, the price,

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:21.401
and its status, for example,

00:00:21.431 --> 00:00:22.121
Confirmed.

00:00:22.757 --> 00:00:25.020
Tap View booking details to see more:

00:00:25.193 --> 00:00:29.740
who will look after you, the time, and the salon's address and phone number.

00:00:30.357 --> 00:00:33.187
If you need to cancel, tap Cancel booking.

00:00:33.692 --> 00:00:36.631
The salon's cancellation policy appears, for example,

00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:40.227
free cancellation up to twenty-four hours before your appointment.

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:42.307
Tap Confirm cancellation.

00:00:42.662 --> 00:00:44.707
The booking's status changes to Cancelled.

00:00:45.329 --> 00:00:46.161
A small note:

00:00:46.386 --> 00:00:50.881
if the cancellation deadline has already passed, please contact the salon directly.

00:00:51.141 --> 00:00:55.361
And after your visit, come back here, and tap Leave a review to share how it went.

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:56.881
Now take the quiz below!
